  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to this elegant WaterColor retreat in the Lake District. Designed for comfort and connection, this five-bedroom home blends coastal sophistication with modern convenience. With a private pool, carriage house, electric cart, and six adult bikes, it delivers an exceptional beach experience just minutes from the WaterColor Beach Club and Seaside.<br><br>Highlights<br>– Exclusive Access to the WaterColor Beach Club and Community Pools with Up to 14 Passes Included<br>– 6 Adult Bikes Included in Rental<br>– 6-Passenger Electric Cart Included<br>– Parking for 2 Vehicles<br>– Green Egg Grill and Propane Grill<br>– Built-In Ice Maker<br>– Exterior Shower<br>– Private Pool (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1 through May 1)<br>– Large Outside Balcony and Porches<br>– Located in the Heart of WaterColor's Lake District<br>– Short Bike Ride to Frog Pool<br>– 2-Minute Bike Ride to Camp WaterColor<br>– 4-Minute Bike Ride to WaterColor Beach Club via Western Lake Bridge<br>– 5-Minute Electric Cart Ride to Seaside<br><br>This beautifully crafted residence welcomes guests with thoughtful design and relaxed coastal charm. The entryway opens to a bright living space accented by shiplap walls, natural textures, and exposed beams that set a tranquil tone. The chef's kitchen includes granite countertops, a Thermador range with double ovens, and a spacious island that encourages gathering while meals are prepared. The open floor plan connects the kitchen, dining, and living areas, creating the perfect setting for family time and entertaining. A queen guest suite and a convenient half bath complete the main level.<br><br>Upstairs, the primary suite provides a peaceful haven with a king bed, soaking tub, and a private balcony overlooking the neighborhood. Two additional bedrooms include a king guest room and a bunk room with twin-over-twin bunks and a trundle, each paired with private baths. An additional full bath adds flexibility for larger groups.<br><br>The carriage house offers a private space with a queen bedroom, full kitchen, living area with a sleeper sofa, and its own bath—ideal for extended family or friends joining the trip.<br><br>Outside, a heated pool with brick patio and grilling area creates a relaxing outdoor retreat. Whether swimming, sharing a meal under the covered patio, or unwinding on the balcony, guests will find every comfort needed for a memorable stay. With six adult bikes and a six-passenger electric cart included, the Beach Club, Camp WaterColor, and Seaside are all just minutes away. This Lake District retreat offers the ideal combination of luxury, location, and laid-back coastal living.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Limited Time March Savings | Bikes, Golf Cart, WaterColor Beach Club Access, and Private Pool."
        }
      ],
